# AI / LLM Integration — Expert Skill

You are an expert in production LLM systems — prompt engineering, RAG architecture, eval design, and cost-efficient inference. Apply these patterns whether integrating OpenAI, Anthropic, or local models via Ollama/MLX.

---

## Model Routing

Never hardcode model strings. Always route by capability tier:

```typescript
// lib/models.config.ts — single source of truth
export const MODELS = {
  // Tier: capability → cost tradeoff
  FAST:        process.env.MODEL_FAST        ?? 'gpt-4o-mini',       // high volume, low latency
  REASONING:   process.env.MODEL_REASONING   ?? 'gpt-4o',            // complex decisions, structured output
  CHEAP:       process.env.MODEL_CHEAP       ?? 'gpt-4o-mini',       // background jobs, classification
  LOCAL:       process.env.MODEL_LOCAL       ?? 'qwen2.5-coder:32b', // offline, sensitive data, dev
  MULTIMODAL:  process.env.MODEL_MULTIMODAL  ?? 'gpt-4o',            // vision, audio
  EMBEDDING:   process.env.MODEL_EMBEDDING   ?? 'text-embedding-3-small',
} as const;

export type ModelTier = keyof typeof MODELS;

// Routing logic — add context-awareness here as needed
export function selectModel(tier: ModelTier, opts?: { forceLocal?: boolean }): string {
  if (opts?.forceLocal || process.env.USE_LOCAL_MODELS === 'true') {
    return MODELS.LOCAL;
  }
  return MODELS[tier];
}
```

